+// Live pixel re-probe: the pixel probe seeds HERMES_TUI_BACKGROUND at launch,
+// but a session can move between hosts (or a host can change its theme) while
+// running — Herdr panes especially, since OSC replies are swallowed and the
+// TUI never hears about the new colors.  Re-run the probe command on an
+// interval and re-apply the theme when the measured background moves, so the
+// polarity fixes itself without a restart.
+const LIVE_PROBE_INTERVAL_MS = 30_000
